Customer proof: one Markdown file per quote or case study, shown in the
"From clients" section (src/components/Proof.astro). While this folder has
no .md file, no proof section is rendered anywhere, and CI checks that.

Each file needs this frontmatter (src/lib/proof-schema.ts); the build fails
without it:

---
attribution: Jane Doe, CTO          # as the person agreed to be named
organization: Example Ltd           # optional
source: Email to Satyajit, 2026-11-03
permission: Written permission to publish, email 2026-11-04
date: 2026-11-03
hosts: [www, tokvera]               # optional; all three when omitted
---

The quote or case study, in the person's words. Numbers in it are theirs,
backed by the source and permission above.
